#2151
goblin picket sentry guard~
the goblin picket~
A goblin picket leans on its spear at the edge of the camp.
~
    The picket is a lean goblin in a coat of rings borrowed off
something bigger, and its whole job is to watch the road and be
somewhere else before the road watches back.  It has stopped
leaning on the spear.
~
