#2152
warg goblin hound beast~
a camp warg~
A camp warg slinks between the trees, nose down.
~
    Half hound and half something the goblins should not have been
breeding, the warg is grey, low to the ground and all shoulder.  It
has learned that the camp feeds it and the forest does not, and it
hunts the treeline for anything that looks like it came to be fed
upon.
~
