#2153
goblin shaman herb priest~
the goblin shaman~
A goblin shaman counts feathers in the corner of her hut.
~
    She is small even for her kind and hung about with bundles of
dried herb, yellow bone beads and the feathers of birds nobody has
seen lately.  Her voice is a dry rattle, and the herds of the camp
come to her door before they come to the chieftain's.
~
