#2154
hobgoblin drillmaster sergeant~
a hobgoblin drillmaster~
A hobgoblin drillmaster counts the camp under its breath.
~
    Tall for a goblin and broad as a man, the drillmaster wears the
camp's only honest uniform:  a blackened breastplate, a rank-knot
of red cord at the shoulder, and a stick of ironwood it has never
once had to use twice on the same goblin.  It is counting you
already.
~
