#2155
bugbear overseer slave driver~
a bugbear overseer~
A bugbear overseer walks the camp with a lash coiled in its fist.
~
    The overseer stands a head taller than the goblins it drives and
a good deal wider than any of them, yellow-fanged and stinking of
the smoke pit.  It keeps the larder, the meat racks and the tally of
who owes the camp a day's work, and it collects.
~
