#2156
kobold warlock sorcerer captive~
a kobold warlock~
A kobold warlock mutters over a bowl of river water.
~
    Brought down out of the caves as a slave and kept on as
something more useful than a slave, the warlock is a small, wet-
looking kobold whose horns have been ringed with copper by its
masters.  It will tell you at length that it serves the goblins by
choice, and its eyes stay on the door the whole time it says so.
~
