#2157
goblin flesh-render butcher cook~
a goblin flesh-render~
A goblin flesh-render works at the hearth with a bone saw.
~
    The render is enormous through the arms and philosophically
calm, and it does the camp's butchering, its cooking and most of
its arithmetic about meat.  It regards you the way it regards the
haunches on the rack, and it is very good at its work.
~
