#2158
hobgoblin legionnaire soldier~
a hobgoblin legionnaire~
A hobgoblin legionnaire stands the watch inside the hide hut.
~
    The legionnaire's kit is old, well kept and not of goblin
make:  a curved shield, a short heavy spear and a helm that has
been worn down to a dull shine.  It has served the camp longer
than the chieftain has, and it intends to go on serving it
afterwards.
~
