#2159
ghrask goblin war-chief chieftain chief~
Ghrask, the Goblin War-Chief~
Ghrask, the Goblin War-Chief, sits the stolen chair on its mound.
~
    Ghrask is not the largest goblin in the camp and does not need
to be.  The boar-tusk crown is real, the wolf hide on the chair is
real, and so is the ledger of debts the chieftain keeps in a
skull by the throne, written in a hand that has clearly had
practice.  Raids are called here, and the forest road out of the
valley is closed because Ghrask closed it.
~
